ing\n\n【詳細】\n①服装と髪型\n　過度な露出のない服装であればお好きなようにアレンジしていただいて大丈夫です。\n\n②構図\n　https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j9RGt9Z_UeE\n　上記のMVイラストのような構図でお願いできればと思います。\n\n③サイズ\n　拡大して使用する可能性があるため、少し大きめの2560×1440pでご制作していただけると非常に助かります。\n\n④ファイル形式\n　背景透過、背景のみ、サインオン/オフ版をPSDデータでいただけますと幸いです。\n　\nまた、サムネイルや宣伝画像制作時に簡単な色味調整を行わせていただく場合がございます。\n\nお忙しいところ恐縮ですが、ご縁がありましたらぜひよろしくお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/11Kh5TyPkqSSxvwATnnGMv0YMSg_bpLwt?usp=sharing", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@chocolate00327/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1552044, "client_id": 3483570, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2b07ebe8/uploads/origins/1f2260dd-ede5-44c7-958a-3dd0c6bc35b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=59104340a7c35e689ae53717e2785b01", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2b07ebe8/uploads/origins/1f2260dd-ede5-44c7-958a-3dd0c6bc35b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=59104340a7c35e689ae53717e2785b01, https://si.imgix.net/2b07ebe8/uploads/origins/1f2260dd-ede5-44c7-958a-3dd0c6bc35b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bbeddfb39af04d8e0fc1b108ba6492d3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2b07ebe8/uploads/origins/1f2260dd-ede5-44c7-958a-3dd0c6bc35b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=59473333f7a13855f8c0b05cd3035981 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2b07ebe8/uploads/origins/1f2260dd-ede5-44c7-958a-3dd0c6bc35b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d2ef3e6238425bafef449320e54ba830", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2b07ebe8/uploads/origins/1f2260dd-ede5-44c7-958a-3dd0c6bc35b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d2ef3e6238425bafef449320e54ba830, https://si.imgix.net/2b07ebe8/uploads/origins/1f2260dd-ede5-44c7-958a-3dd0c6bc35b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1d237cdac159a6aedebeb9af3945e1e8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2b07ebe8/uploads/origins/1f2260dd-ede5-44c7-958a-3dd0c6bc35b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f64a814834ad5071a604d88000f44911 3x"}, "body": "Dear moca\n\nIt is nice to meet you.\nMy name is Sayo Yoitai, and I am currently preparing to become a VTuber.\n\nI was strongly attracted by the delicate and lovely illustration of a girl by moca, and I would like to send a request for you to draw an illustration for me.\nI would appreciate it if you could consider my request.\n\nPurpose of use\nWe plan to use the illustration mainly as a thumbnail for a YouTube stream, as an icon on various social networking sites, and for publicity.\nIt may also be used for online prints that do not generate revenue.\n\nAppearance\nCharacter designs will be shared on Google Drive.\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/11Kh5TyPkqSSxvwATnnGMv0YMSg_bpLwt?usp=sharing\n\n【Details\n(1) Clothing and hairstyle\n　We will leave all arrangements to you, but since the character has a young appearance, we would prefer less direct exposure of skin.\n\n2) Composition\n　We would greatly appreciate it if you could draw the head, hair, and accessories in a way that they are not cut off, as they will be used as thumbnails, etc. We will leave the poses, etc. to you.\n　Poses, etc. are left up to the artist.\n\n(3) Size\n　We would greatly appreciate it if you could make the image a little larger in size, as it may be enlarged for use.\n\n4) File format\n　We would appreciate it if you could provide us with the transparent background, background only, and signed on/off versions as PSD data.\n\nIf possible, we would appreciate it if you could leave the creation of facial expression differences to us.\nWe may also make simple color adjustments when creating thumbnails and promotional images.\n\nThank you for your time, and we look forward to working with you.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/11Kh5TyPkqSSxvwATnnGMv0YMSg_bpLwt?usp=sharing", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 127108, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "千歳ゆうり", "screen_name": "Chitose_utatane", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1750900386175848448/Bssn5j21.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1070686745761476611/1710122697/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 100, "skills": [{"genre": "novel"}, {"genre": "voice"}, {"genre": "music"}], "banned": false, "nc": 1}, {"id": 189387, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "多間硝子💤ギーツ6話まで視聴中ネタバレやめて", "screen_name": "Tamashoko_", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2005969560932081667/LwCPS3Zd.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1163104173870555136/1765113067/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "voice"}, {"genre": "novel"}], "banned": false, "nc": 145}, {"id": 556588, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "花畑しお", "screen_name": "flower_4o", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2110935609154088960/N7FP866l.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1274329784034537473/1722061919/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank